  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Run clean fingertips along the flesh and remove remaining pin bones with tweezers.</li><li>Pat both sides very dry; season just before cooking.</li><li>If using frozen fillets, thaw in the fridge first, removing keep-frozen vacuum packaging before thawing.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-1",
