   "time": "3–5 min",
   "time_html": "<span>3–5 min</span>",
   "title": "Crisp the skin",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"350\">350 g</span>",
     "name_html": "Sea bream fillets, skin-on, pin bones removed"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tbsp</span>",
     "name_html": "Olive oil"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Slide the spatula fully underneath; turn once.</li><li>Cook the flesh side for 1–3 minutes, depending on thickness.</li><li>Check <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"temp\" data-u=\"C\" data-a=\"63\" data-s=\"0\">63 °C</span></b> in the thickest part; the flesh should separate easily.</li><li>Transfer to warm plates.</li><li>Time is a guide, not the doneness test.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "medium",
    "label_html": "<span>medium</span>",
    "off": false
   },
