     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"350\">350 g</span>",
     "name_html": "Sea bream fillets, skin-on, pin bones removed"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Take the pan off the heat.</li><li>Carefully add water and lemon; swirl in optional butter and capers for 20–30 seconds.</li><li>Spoon around the fish so the skin stays crisp.</li><li>Add optional chopped parsley and lemon wedges; serve immediately.</li></ul>",
